<html>
  <head>
    <title>My Blog</title>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>My Blog</header>
    <div class="content">
      <nav>
        <ul>
          <li class="categories">Life Updates</li>
          <li class="categories">Rants & Reviews</li>
          <li class="categories">Infodumping</li>
          <li class="categories">Tutorials</li>
          <li class="categories">Artwork</li>
          <li class="categories">Programming</li>
          <li class="categories">Miscellaneous</li>
          <div class="controls">
            <li><button>Post</button></li>
          </div>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <main>
        <div class="post_preview">
          <h6>Post #</h6>
          <h5>Life Updates</h5>
          <h2>My First Post</h2>
          <p> Hello, and welcome to my blog! :D <br>Here, I'll be doing many things! Talk about my life (not too much of course, haha), rant about media (or glaze it), infodumping about my interests, maybe give a tutorial or two, don't count on it, and share my artwork and projects! I'm making this so I don't hate web development as much, gotta get used to it for my job, but if you happen to stumble onto this, enjoy the view! Hopefully, I'll be spending lots of time tweaking this, so expect it to be ever-changing! Thanks for dropping in, and see you on the next one! </p>
          <h5>Updated on </h5>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <footer>Made with &lt;3 by Sienna</footer>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
